 "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/blogger/v3/blogs/6417357851361576411/posts/2696778241919146494",
 "title": "Steps to win in life!!!",
 "content": "<h1 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><u><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\">Steps to win in life!!!</span></i></u></span></span></h1><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Most of us want to become successful people in life. In this blog, I'd like to share my thoughts and ideas on \"how to win in life.\"</span></p><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"5\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Dedication</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"6\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Be dedicated to your motive or goal. If you like to become a sportsman, keep practicing until you attain the perfection stage. Keep attentive to your vision.</span></p><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"7\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #20124d;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Patience:</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"8\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Life is a big game. No one knows when their good time will come. We should keep practising until our time has come. Keep yourself updated on your field.Pay attention to your vision.</span></p><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"8\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjZEPAxLb9dXDH6bs13Y61SuLBZ1YzOsqN6gS1B8AeXjwLrLu_FAwnJsysDJuDMy9ITvO-OlXnf1F7mt4WTBPDEAfOh0wg52piVX8ywLcm6m-vpYyjV_woPvZCPKtIBALKJGVtRIgIbmR9NTmwVizNys5Df9_EUsPcfSCYx9RbR-4AatGcPZpTXZWAR6g=s4592\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3056\" data-original-width=\"4592\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjZEPAxLb9dXDH6bs13Y61SuLBZ1YzOsqN6gS1B8AeXjwLrLu_FAwnJsysDJuDMy9ITvO-OlXnf1F7mt4WTBPDEAfOh0wg52piVX8ywLcm6m-vpYyjV_woPvZCPKtIBALKJGVtRIgIbmR9NTmwVizNys5Df9_EUsPcfSCYx9RbR-4AatGcPZpTXZWAR6g=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />&nbsp;</span><p></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #04ff00;\"><span style=\"color: #2b00fe;\"><u><b><span style=\"font-family: times;\">please disable adblocker and allow us to show some advertisements.</span></b></u></span></span></span></i></span></span></i></h4><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"9\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #20124d;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Expectation:</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"10\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Don't expect too much of anything in life. If you want to become successful in life, you have to put in your hard work.</span></p><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"11\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #7f6000;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Stay calm</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"12\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Good things need time to happen.There is a popular saying, \"Rome wasn't built in a day,\" so don't expect an immediate success. Keep yourself updated and wait for your turn. Keep your mind as calm as possible.</span></p><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"12\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgw-CyzN-g-wKLKf18DCtFk9kbAVOQmVbiAr7w_q8oP8PFgPAVm7-gyF9g2ZXCWMAnX_uzcibEy_ljwHILTtEvHfDBScZcY-eyYpWmpMy9hvaCjg8fhe0Mc4SqnaO98DxLG1_zs8Cak9egTF2HvnkMvehX5s9eFVErjPYKEFdwz3PEzoXRL5IZ3qKhBBw=s7952\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"5304\" data-original-width=\"7952\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgw-CyzN-g-wKLKf18DCtFk9kbAVOQmVbiAr7w_q8oP8PFgPAVm7-gyF9g2ZXCWMAnX_uzcibEy_ljwHILTtEvHfDBScZcY-eyYpWmpMy9hvaCjg8fhe0Mc4SqnaO98DxLG1_zs8Cak9egTF2HvnkMvehX5s9eFVErjPYKEFdwz3PEzoXRL5IZ3qKhBBw=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />&nbsp;</span><p></p><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"13\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #0b5394;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Mental strength</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"14\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">If you want to master a skill in life, then you should keep practicing it without giving importance to other opinions, because sometimes people around you keep degrading you and downgrading your efforts. You should have the mental strength to handle those situations.</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/2021/07/why-indians-are-too-religious.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #351c75;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Religion in India..?🤔click here!!!</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></i></u></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"15\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #783f04;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Acceptance</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"16\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">It is okay if you don't know something. Don't be shy about accepting your ignorance. Keep learning it. Don't hesitate to learn new things and explore them.</span></p><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"16\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"16\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgIPWBwSYhg6GH-F_AXtt7sR3xtFS-ajVx9KFKgCvlwvfmmDxZ2KKL0Wv-edvbIRrxRMchtMmTh3rS20hnejMu2PuV3tqQ6kGFBsl39rt6-sFsXsfF2a0vFYrVs61SKTGDjQU4JMwBfGNB-cnZmlRBsuZU2TUXZWaqbBoVdc79WkDuG8S7CMtH73F9KZg=s4235\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"4235\" data-original-width=\"2829\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgIPWBwSYhg6GH-F_AXtt7sR3xtFS-ajVx9KFKgCvlwvfmmDxZ2KKL0Wv-edvbIRrxRMchtMmTh3rS20hnejMu2PuV3tqQ6kGFBsl39rt6-sFsXsfF2a0vFYrVs61SKTGDjQU4JMwBfGNB-cnZmlRBsuZU2TUXZWaqbBoVdc79WkDuG8S7CMtH73F9KZg=s320\" width=\"214\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />&nbsp;</span><p></p><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><h3 class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"17\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #a64d79;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Fitness</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Keep yourself fit.and give importance to physical exercise.</span></p><p class=\"root-block-node\" data-changed=\"false\" data-paragraphid=\"18\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/p/trending-posts_53.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #351c75;\"><u><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Trending posts..😲😵click here!!!</span></span></i></u></span></a></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><i><span style=\"color: red;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\">Thanks for reading this blog,please share with others and help us to grow<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">.</span></span></span></b></span></i></span></u></span></span></i><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><br /><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><b><br /></b></u></span></span></span></i></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><b>Please visit this blog again!!!we uploads articles daily!!!!😀😀</b></u></span></span></span></i></span></h2><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">\n</span